# Claude Code (personal)
.claude/*
# ...except the skills whose content is canon and should be tracked/distributed. The rest
# of .claude/skills is wired in locally from src/clients-ts/petbox-wire templates and stays
# untracked. Un-ignore each level explicitly — git will not descend into an ignored dir.
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/petbox-methodology/
!.claude/skills/analysis-workspace/
!.claude/skills/factory-run/

# opencode (personal)
.opencode/
.agents/

